Enhancement Effect - Superior Reflexes	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|INITIATIVE|1+floor((%CHOICE-1)/4)	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|VAR|SPHERES_RECEIVED_SUPERIOR_REFLEXES_AOO|1+floor((%CHOICE-1)/4)	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Received Superior Reflexes. Initiative and additional attacks of opportunity increase by 1 at caster levels 5, 9, 13, and every 4 thereafter. Allows attacks of opportunity while flat-footed. Track their expenditure at the table; this does not grant Combat Reflexes. Remove when the enhancement expires.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
Enhancement Effect - Spectral Enhancement - Conditional Saves	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SAVE|ALL|2+floor(%CHOICE/5)|TYPE=Circumstance	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY for saves against possession or negative energy effects while wearing armor granted ghost touch by Spectral Enhancement with the additional spell point paid. Disable immediately afterward. This does not grant ghost touch, negative energy resistance, or any benefit to an enhanced weapon. Enter the effect caster level, not the wearer level.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
