Enhancement Effect - Lighten - Half Weight - Conditional CMD	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|CMD|-2	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY while resolving bull rush, drag, or reposition against a creature affected by Lighten (half weight). Disable immediately afterward. Choose only one Lighten weight state. Does not change body weight, armor, movement, or ordinary CMD.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
Enhancement Effect - Lighten - Weightless or Floating - Conditional CMD	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|CMD|-4	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY while resolving bull rush, drag, or reposition against a creature affected by Lighten (weightless or floating). Disable immediately afterward. Choose only one Lighten weight state. Does not change body weight, armor, movement, or ordinary CMD.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
Enhancement Effect - Lighten - Levitating Attack	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|TOHIT|-%CHOICE	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=5|TITLE=Choose attack penalty since last stabilization (maximum 5)	TEMPDESC:For weapon attacks while levitating from Lighten only. Choose 1 for the first attack, 2 for the second, up to 5. Replace this modifier as the penalty advances. A full-round action stabilizing resets the next attack to 1. Disable for nonweapon attacks and remove on landing or expiration. Does not automatically count attacks or spend actions.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
Enhancement Effect - Alter Movement - Conditional Skills	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SKILL|Acrobatics,Climb,Fly,Swim|2+2*floor(%CHOICE/5)|TYPE=Enhancement	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY for a check while using the movement speed increased by Alter Movement. Disable immediately afterward; other movement modes and checks do not benefit. Use the caster level when cast.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
Enhancement Effect - Cripple	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|TOHIT,INITIATIVE|-2-floor(%CHOICE/5)	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SAVE|ALL|-2-floor(%CHOICE/5)	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SKILL|ALL|-2-floor(%CHOICE/5)	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Received Cripple. Applies penalties to attack rolls, saves, skills and initiative (a Dexterity check). Apply the same penalty to other ability checks at the table; ability scores themselves are unchanged. Enter caster level when cast. Target legality, saving throw, duration and spell points remain player-managed. Remove when the effect ends.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement
